    "detailed_description": "For one reason or another, your employer has a LOT of bombs. No one would send out untested bombs, so it's QAs job to defuse them! Wait... are cakes normally bombs? Never mind that. Chase the clock, snip red wires, and try not to think too hard about the logistics in SHORT FUSE!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defuse Bombs!</h2>Endure wave after wave of bombs that\u2019ll have you questioning why they would even exist.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803370/extras/b2c2d1a565bbfeadb55f5ffc57cbd371.poster.avif?t=1738248231\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803370/extras/b2c2d1a565bbfeadb55f5ffc57cbd371.webm?t=1738248231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803370/extras/b2c2d1a565bbfeadb55f5ffc57cbd371.mp4?t=1738248231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Augment Your Run</h2>Pick up floppy disks after each wave that alters the way you play. An interactive state-of-the-art computer allows you to purchase items with instant delivery. Who knows? Maybe you\u2019ll find something intriguing\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803370/extras/09660a4eeff6d99e67293c8bd6d65501.poster.avif?t=1738248231\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803370/extras/09660a4eeff6d99e67293c8bd6d65501.webm?t=1738248231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803370/extras/09660a4eeff6d99e67293c8bd6d65501.mp4?t=1738248231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore The Company</h2>This operation is too big to be confined to one tiny, dark room. Through your actions you may be able to figure out what\u2019s really happening on the inside.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803370/extras/7aa5fc68969a60dc8e284674b99eb1c2.poster.avif?t=1738248231\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803370/extras/7aa5fc68969a60dc8e284674b99eb1c2.webm?t=1738248231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803370/extras/7aa5fc68969a60dc8e284674b99eb1c2.mp4?t=1738248231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
