s operation is too big to be confined to one tiny, dark room. Through your actions you may be able to figure out what\u2019s really happening on the inside.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803370/extras/7aa5fc68969a60dc8e284674b99eb1c2.poster.avif?t=1738248231\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803370/extras/7aa5fc68969a60dc8e284674b99eb1c2.webm?t=1738248231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803370/extras/7aa5fc68969a60dc8e284674b99eb1c2.mp4?t=1738248231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
